config ZMK_PHYSICAL_KEYS
    bool "Expose physical key positions over Bluetooth"
    depends on ZMK_BLE && ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL
    help
      Read/notify the physical key bitmap, before combos and hold-taps.
      Optional companion service for the Omarchy Corne typing aid.
      Requires an encrypted Bluetooth connection; disabled by default.
